repository-code: https://github.com/sparkainlp-x/shared-gate-recall
abstract: >-
  One canonical module for the Youden refusal gate and overlap
  recall duplicated across the public sparkainlp-x repos: a
  strategy-parameterised calibration (first | midpoint, keyword-only
  with no default, one documented grid convention), a deterministic
  bootstrap tau interval, and overlap recall over stored patterns
  with a frozen gate. Explicitly not outer-product W-matrix storage.
  Classical synthetic toy; no medical, quantum-hardware, brain, or
  consciousness claim.
keywords:
  - refusal gate
  - Youden's J
  - overlap recall
  - calibration
  - synthetic toy
